---
import Install from './Install.astro';
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
---

<section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <Mark size={48} />
  <h2 id="closing-title">Run your first lane</h2>
  <p>
    Install devlanes, describe your stack in a <code>devlanes.yaml</code> at the root of the
    repository, run <code>devlanes start</code>.
  </p>
  <Install id="install-again" />
  <div class="closing-facts">
    <p>
      devlanes is in beta. Presets cover Vite, Next, Wrangler and Tauri; Compose files and plain
      containers work as infra. Lanes keep ports, hostnames and data apart; they are not a sandbox,
      every process runs as you. A remote connection never runs commands on the box.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
